  m_Name: 2Wasp
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  CardPages:
  - The Viceroy of the Wasps is pleased to welcome her new queen!
  - We are a collective consciousness living as a hive. We grow beautiful gardens
    and care for nature.
  - And after the war of unification, we began to grow crops for our new king.
  - That's what I wanted to say.
  - This is our only way of moving and communicating with people.
  - Every day I ask myself why Alexander left us the right to live...
  - The Queen is certainly right, but soon we will not be able to fulfill our duty.
  - We need new bodies
  Card_name: Viceroy of the OS
  LeftChoice:
    text: I will give the bodies of the criminals
